<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - R.R. Donnelley raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - R.R. Donnelley raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Lanny Baker upgraded R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co to strong buy from hold, with a preliminary 12-month price target of $40-$42 a share.</p>
<p>-- Noted company named William Davis as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>-- Cited Davis's willingness to undertake &quot;major restructuring.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said believes company's margin deterioration will be turned around.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose two to 32-3/8.</p>
</text>
